  "notes": "A lambda that fails inside a method fails that method: decompile-all --json names the failed body in the enclosing method's nested_errors (and its error), and a failed field-initializer lambda in the class record's nested_errors. The fixture fails by construction (tests/fixtures/jvm/failures/README.md).",
